        "@type": "xsd:date"
      },
      "estleg:versionText": "Tervishoiukorralduse seadus (RT I 1994, 10, 133; 1995, 57, 978; 1997, 86, 1462; 1999, 18, 305; 23, 351; 97, 860; 2000, 57, 374; 58, 376) tunnistatakse kehtetuks.",
